This software is an internal, proprietary extension layer for the LiteLLM
proxy. It is not licensed for redistribution. It intentionally contains no
code from, and takes no dependency on, LiteLLM's `enterprise/` directory or
the `litellm_enterprise` package (which are commercially licensed by
BerriAI). All enterprise-equivalent functionality here is a clean-room
implementation against LiteLLM's public OSS extension points.
